  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.18 Waiver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.18 Waiver. A person may submit a written request to the commissioner for a waiver from the administrative requirements prescribed by these rules. The written request shall indicate all factual information and reasons in support of why the commissioner should approve the waiver.\n\nSource. #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
